~ start
match PlayerStats.curr_level
	when "start"
		Max: Who needs a wardrobe when you can put all your clothes on the floor.
		Max: ...
		Max: I should probably put them in my perfectly empty duffle bag
	when "messy_house"
		% 
			Max: What was once a messy pile of clothes...
			Max: Is now a messier pile of clothes.
		% Max: I should really get a wardrobe soon.
=> END